# token-on-turn over its range: Bot1 wears five, one for each token it may make and turns 1 to 4 - a Soldier and a Thopter
# on its first turn, a Goblin on its second, an Elf Warrior on its third, a Spirit on its fourth. Each "at the beginning of
# your upkeep, if it's your Nth turn, create ..." makes its token under Bot1's control (CR 111.1) as its text describes it
# (CR 111.4), on that upkeep only: Bot2's turns and Bot1's fifth turn make none.

